{"time": 1756687197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610316808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1083804103]\"活着，不需要理由。\"她的话语稍显冷漠，右手掐了掐你的脸颊，\"明白吗？\""}
