{"time": 1756690271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894348133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（龙族二去拍卖场路上亦有记载）"}
{"time": 1756690418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519375614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（“总得有个活着的理由……所以才不会某天突然跳一个试试。哈哈，快想！在你快死的时候，心里会想什么？”）"}
{"time": 1756690472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587762611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前....我的记忆就短暂缺失了一段...会不会当时..我记忆又被修改了，会不会其实是我杀了大家，又或者我是帮凶......所以只有我没有被杀.....”越想感觉越害怕"}
{"time": 1756690482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273280735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是其实90%甚至99%的人不会特意去想自己为什么而活）"}
{"time": 1756690489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589666104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只是活着而已）"}
{"time": 1756690493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046444000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那倒确实（））"}
{"time": 1756690536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484282653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不过90％到99％的人都有不能去死的理由）"}
{"time": 1756690636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655336225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2129114185]“再见，以防下次见面的时候我已经把梦忘干净了，就提前说了。我理解，但是不太赞同‘你们’的观点，但……有时候也不是不能接受”*闭上眼，再重新睁开"}
{"time": 1756690864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1172233810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1655336225]无人回应，再次睁开眼，你看见了牢房的天花板"}
