{"time": 1756743604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735098589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1756743731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226641828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这个嘛...\"她停顿了一下，\"你们为什么不去一旁的办公室问问宾森特呢？\"她指了指一旁挂着治安官门牌的木门"}
{"time": 1756743756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551460455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们可以直接去问吗...”"}
{"time": 1756743778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370804990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（们是？）"}
{"time": 1756743793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948627448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我也要取东西啊）"}
{"time": 1756743827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729977821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难道要我帮你们去问?\"她的态度说不上好，也说不上差，可能是刚刚被气的。"}
{"time": 1756743832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145312115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有们”*径直走向那扇门"}
{"time": 1756743843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359842947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟上去"}
{"time": 1756743844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716880698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*抬手敲门"}
{"time": 1756744134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011590740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"请进。\"门被传来熟悉的中年人烟嗓，\"欢迎二位，越狱犯伊芙艾络温摩根，不安定分子诺维拉温斯特，门没锁。\""}
{"time": 1756744169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947186050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（大人，我是良民（bushi）"}
{"time": 1756744201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140995553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*按下门把手，光明正大地走进去"}
{"time": 1756744221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2092137583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他叫啥来着）"}
{"time": 1756744227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740243461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟着进去，看看剑放在哪里"}
{"time": 1756744361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816315351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(宾森特)"}
{"time": 1756744421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866483300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“宾森特先生，倒是确实对这监狱了如指掌”"}
{"time": 1756744547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158733064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当然，毕竟这里是我的领域。\"他戴着手套的手里把玩着血晶制作的匕首，椅子旁边靠着两把藏在剑鞘里的剑，没有看你们，\"称我为泰坦也不为过。\""}
{"time": 1756744568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103776873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“宾森特先生，我可以拿回我的剑吗”"}
{"time": 1756744649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1604544138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然那本来就是我的东西，但是我姑且一问。要我做什么？”"}
{"time": 1756744907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842214083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"对现状一无所知，真是令人安心的愚昧。\"他嗤笑了一声，随后恢复了古井无波的样子，灰色的眸子里有一种超然的平静，\"尽管去尝试好啦，在这已经...不再是马纳利亚的马纳利亚。\"他手一甩，匕首朝伊芙扔过去，\"我只在乎律法和均衡，言尽于此。\""}
{"time": 1756744954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191470505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*眉间感觉有点刺痛，伸手去接那匕首"}
{"time": 1756745010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290587842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看艾洛温都拿回了自己的匕首“前辈，我可以把我剑拿走吗”"}
{"time": 1756745077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368129586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我讨厌谜语人”*皱眉“你的底气来自于你的眼界，还是别人的眼界？”"}
{"time": 1756745099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "24878183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "匕首稳稳当当地落在你手上，\"西里斯小姐做事向来有理由，为你们保释一次，下不为例。\"他当然不会把剑递给你，你只能自己去拿。"}
{"time": 1756745131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983323222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小步跑过去把剑取了“谢谢前辈”"}
{"time": 1756745172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63016050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"老夫说过...此处，说不定称老夫为泰坦也不为过。\"他摆摆手，麦哲从门外进来，\"两位，请离开吧。\""}
{"time": 1756745205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335992059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“前辈告辞了”挥挥手，转身离开"}
{"time": 1756745332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1000485440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你的优越感的源头还真是无聊。你是那种和同事出去吃饭还要比谁的钱带的多的人吗？”"}
{"time": 1756745449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431196589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"实话实说。\"宾森特表情一直没什么变化，最后回复完四个字就不再开口。"}
{"time": 1756745484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983756700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听不懂谜语，直接回去找西莉丝了"}
{"time": 1756745494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078495227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐，我们下来去哪”"}
{"time": 1756745623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471020614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙神呢)"}
{"time": 1756745643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897273691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“原来这年头活的久也算本钱了。独占着资源不分出去，还要嘲弄没有它的人，在你律法的治下还真是无趣。虽然我也没那么喜欢卡珊德拉，但也比和你相处好得多”*连同自己的毒物一起收回原处"}
{"time": 1756745727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651537243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "桌上并没有你携带的一堆微弱毒素"}
{"time": 1756745959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034764369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*算了，也不值钱"}
{"time": 1756746029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016055843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“走了，告辞，宾森特阁下”*出门，准备按原计划，先找个住处，再想想穿山甲鳞粉的事"}
{"time": 1756746051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321764831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对于你的话他没有回复，或许是不置可否的意思。麦哲把你带出去关上门，\"虽然头儿一向是这样，但是伊芙小姐也不能说得太无礼了。\"他摇摇头，压低声音，\"总之...小心其他自称泰坦的人。\""}
{"time": 1756746098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953481924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1078495227]\"诺维拉想去哪?\"她没看你，只是回了一句话"}
{"time": 1756746159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768531702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我想先去给师父她们收尸,顺便看看有没有什么线索”"}
{"time": 1756746240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446122096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=321764831]*撇撇嘴“谢谢，你比他看起来顺眼多了……啧，要是师母留了什么给我就好了，也不至于在哪都抬不起头……最后只给我留了一天十公里的跑步任务”"}
{"time": 1756746271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128803308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1756775910, "type": "reply", "message_id": "644713805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1756775963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128422535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1768531702]（）"}
{"time": 1756776090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182683271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1768531702]“做不到。”语气有些淡淡的，“现在这个情况，离不开中环。”"}
{"time": 1756776110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366183609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“发生了什么吗？”"}
{"time": 1756776157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868855285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=446122096]“呵呵...现在知道我的好了吗？”卡珊德拉适时地插上话，“果然还是要靠我吧？”"}
{"time": 1756776293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "369530011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=868855285]“算你厉害咯”*心里说着，在门口驻足回头“什么叫离不开中环？”"}
{"time": 1756776460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652740194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“宾森特对你们说的是实话。”西里斯摇摇头，“虽然仍然处在马纳利亚，但是中环已经不再受制于马纳利亚的规则，同时与外环完全分隔开...这就是现状。”"}
{"time": 1756776511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766265702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为什么会这样？”"}
{"time": 1756776527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953591134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*又扭头看看街上什么情况"}
{"time": 1756776562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65293552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是被分割了，还是被覆盖了呢……”"}
{"time": 1756776590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094906344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "街道倒是没什么变化，身处密密麻麻的法师塔中的小屋显得渺小"}
{"time": 1756776668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678719603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“既然去不了外环...那我可能要先去学院一趟，之前我和一个姐姐有约...”"}
{"time": 1756776735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098609711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“或许异相早在之前就有了眉目...”西里斯看了一眼麦哲，后者接过她的话，“如今的中环受制于三位‘泰坦’，其中之一就是头儿。”"}
{"time": 1756776739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760366005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还有别的人吗）"}
{"time": 1756776764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175064899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（指街上）"}
{"time": 1756776785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "637963585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2094906344]偶尔可见穿着和麦哲相似制服的人在街上路过，神色匆匆"}
{"time": 1756776898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906400157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*也不做声，打算先看屋里这三个人怎么聊"}
{"time": 1756777019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858186977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总之，这中环已经不能适用马纳利亚的规则，到底是谁做的...\"她皱着眉，\"这么大的事情...几天之内...无知无觉\""}
{"time": 1756777136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012429291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我连玛纳利亚的规则都不知道是什么（））"}
{"time": 1756777261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062850655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我连玛纳利亚的规则都不知道是什么（））"}
{"time": 1756777265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624713371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这么说可能确实你不太懂，但是，如果把马纳利亚的规则改成俗世的规则呢)"}
{"time": 1756777271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240450415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不懂就问)"}
{"time": 1756777279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432018738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1756777292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "881233007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“马纳利亚的规则是什么..”"}
{"time": 1756777298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859320444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我也没看出来玛纳利亚有什么和俗世区别很大的规则（））"}
{"time": 1756777486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90962261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“俗世的规则。”西里斯瞥了你们一眼，接着补充，“多了一点伊瑟尔的制约。”"}
{"time": 1756777495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142188038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(本来就没区别"}
{"time": 1756777545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899762023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1756777563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "709285968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那分隔的事情，伊瑟尔也没办法处理吗...”"}
{"time": 1756777621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32413002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*耸耸肩，一副“我说什么来着”的表情"}
{"time": 1756777636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2003907984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“内环也去不了了？”"}
{"time": 1756777712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820635845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“应该吧。”麦哲开口，“除了学院隐约还在学院长的影响之下，中环的其他地方已经分隔成了三位‘泰坦’治下的领域。”"}
{"time": 1756777748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811357933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是那三位搞的吗....”"}
{"time": 1756777791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571562729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“据头儿说，就像是一夜之间...”他皱着眉，看着外面的天空，“不可能，其他两人暂且不论，头儿是绝对不会参与这种事。”"}
{"time": 1756777835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524021183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（显然，这三位是临时政府）"}
{"time": 1756777848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587590043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1756777854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614419327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"宾森特先生是可以信任的。\"西里斯慢悠悠跟上，\"不清楚到底是谁做的，又为什么要做这种麻烦的事。\""}
{"time": 1756777892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591318562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“中环到底有什么值得大费周章的东西，收敛之间？”"}
{"time": 1756778010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211422719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "麦哲摇头，“我不清楚，马纳利亚城中的秘密，要说清楚...大概只有那位学院长才可以吧。”他看了看腕表，“到时间了，我出去巡视了，各位再见。”说完他按了按帽子，离开去了街上。"}
{"time": 1756778031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257758101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“往好处想，外环现在应该还没沦陷”"}
{"time": 1756778230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977158734", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“所以...”西里斯吐出口气，没有再绷紧脸，“外环到底发生了什么，我们根本从来就不清楚呢”"}
{"time": 1756778342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237158562", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果外环已经被攻占，那也没有单独把中环切出来的必要了，直接让大部队进来不就好了？”*简单分析“但是我先前在内环，不知道什么时候就被转移过来了”"}
{"time": 1756778366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682785287", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说不定我也是他们的目标之一”*耸肩，言下之意是，你们也是"}
{"time": 1756778383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408147967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你什么时候在内环了（）"}
{"time": 1756778396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923241854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（学院不在内环在哪）"}
{"time": 1756778411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226945865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（中环啊）"}
{"time": 1756778416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282118872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1756778426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659663091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={11CDDDEF-7410-A806-EC4C-ADC8EDCE9BC3}.gif,sub_type=1,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-11CDDDEF7410A806EC4CADC8EDCE9BC3/0,file_size=23270]"}
{"time": 1756778438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226300838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我还以为进了那个能量门就是内环了）"}
{"time": 1756778455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005646648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=A949A8D049C9A30952850072BEE53EE0.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRy1sI2BgNCJssS2dYbrTKHnxNawxirlQIg_woo5Yrw3f24jwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQXrTj2cFqSdR147uiIybS83oC7X4&amp;rkey=CAESMC86nbKxihcQCihta319hoX9vR_HUabTGi-wrZ02gdQnIXUxojmOgmsonr9fe2lx1A,file_size=35499]"}
{"time": 1756778489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "404710830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果外环已经被攻占，那也没有单独把中环切出来的必要了，直接让大部队进来不就好了？”*简单分析"}
{"time": 1756778512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224807479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={B2B8B9A5-769F-D791-C315-830487B45251}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-B2B8B9A5769FD791C315830487B45251/0,file_size=10664]"}
{"time": 1756778517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213632966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（呃呃）"}
{"time": 1756778527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719218794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1756778615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284895859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“参谋小姐被针对的原因多少可以想得到，但我原本就在学院中，看来学院长的影响也没那么可靠”"}
{"time": 1756778852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1714902632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...在不清楚敌人之前，还是暂时不要怀疑学院长了。”西里斯开口，明显是让你不要再继续的意思，“总之，现在的目标更重要是怎么解决现有的危机。”"}
{"time": 1756778885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724011370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那去收敛办事厅在看看？那里也许有什么线索”"}
{"time": 1756778967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066896894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“显而易见，我帮不上忙。我对魔法一窍不通。说起来学院长是不是根本就不在学院里？”"}
{"time": 1756779144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156164830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“内环，或者说庭院。”西里斯开口，“只对受到邀请之人才会敞开的大门。真要说的话...学院长可以说并不在学院内吧。”"}
{"time": 1756779383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792765358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*想到了什么，回去重新敲宾森特的办公室门。隔着门开口“别让你的手下为了无关痛痒的琐事巡逻了，你治下的地盘就没有更值得在意的地方吗？别人想办法把中环切出来，总不能真的是为了哪个平民吧”"}
{"time": 1756779712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539057822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=792765358]“艾络温小姐，我想你现在还是应该多多少少对我保持一些尊重。”门内只传来淡淡的声音，随后门上的法阵波动把你弹开，“顶撞‘泰坦’本身，也可以视为一种罪。我无意和你解释，请离开。”"}
{"time": 1756779776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578094485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1724011370]西里斯没有回复这句话，若有所思的样子"}
{"time": 1756779861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203378586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1539057822]“别管那些繁文缛节了。你有没有想过，既然他们有办法把人转移到别的地方，那大费周章把中环切出来只能是为了某个地方？”"}
{"time": 1756780126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "703919295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“继续说。”他回复了三个字"}
{"time": 1756780216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28604429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（“继续说。”）"}
{"time": 1756780310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934653576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我是从学院内被弄到那办事厅里的，按那吵人的小个子和西丽丝参谋的说法，他们来自外环。除非他们把人传送的终点只能是收敛办事厅，否则不管他们想做什么，都有更方便的办法吧。”"}
{"time": 1756780344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32349096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那里到底是什么地方？发生过什么？中环还有没有更多这种地方？”"}
{"time": 1756780352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688011313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也是从学院过来的....”"}
{"time": 1756780367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921998255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实还有个问题，为什么是我们）"}
{"time": 1756780396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575917252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1688011313]（你那时候还没跑到……吧）"}
