{"time": 1756797722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800547696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1312708302]\"据我所知，也就只有我了，放心好啦，你的那种劣迹斑斑的本性，姐姐是不会嫌弃的。\""}
{"time": 1756797760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "5055024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“King？这是什么宣传吗？”"}
{"time": 1756798015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878073008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这人就是另外的泰坦了？好自恋，居然说自己是王”小声"}
{"time": 1756798040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106594757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当然是艾希连德凛克大人，伟大的泰坦。\"正在张贴的一个蓝衣人开口，他的袖口带着一圈金币的涂鸦，\"金钱的王，世代的狂。\""}
{"time": 1756798041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715248072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（姓王怎么你了）"}
