{"time": 1757056469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189613755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=945567248]\"其实也没那么格格不入啦，寻常巷陌啦。只是因为这里格外普通，伊芙小姐才会有这样的错觉也说不定\""}
{"time": 1757056645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "778218909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说的就是普通。来之不易，对不对？有时候，其实普通才是小部分吧”"}
{"time": 1757057051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846923543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（普通和理所当然是什么呢（））"}
{"time": 1757057056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347193393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1442458730]\"他们说一边手要有一条啊...\"她眨巴着眼睛，左右手各戴着一条白绳子，\"本来我就没带多少钱...不买的话，好像要被当做奴隶了...\""}
{"time": 1757057104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1342541892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你好像被骗了........只需要一条就可以了吧”"}
{"time": 1757057107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632632586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（孩子本来就傻.jpg）"}
{"time": 1757057136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441064649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你还记得那人在哪吗，我帮你去讨个公道”"}
{"time": 1757057527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042397728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=778218909]\"好吧好吧...你要这么想，我也没什么能说的。\"她打了个哈欠，\"今天的生意就做到这里，关门关门。\""}
{"time": 1757057681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948138313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……告辞”*点点头，微微扯开眼罩再松手放它弹回，迈步出门“之后会记得来还的”"}
{"time": 1757057962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144339346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1948138313]眼罩遮目有一股温润的感觉，左边的眼睛仿佛置入了某种特殊的环境，灼热的感觉消散，你觉得似乎已经恢复了正常。"}
{"time": 1757058027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181110557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1441064649]\"...啊..\"她看了看你，又看了看西里斯的手腕，\"一条...?\"抱着脑袋，半晌不知道说什么"}
