{"time": 1757102203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357853893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不行，推不动。我倒是想进去看看”"}
{"time": 1757102206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438245419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "如果不存在的话，自己昨天中午就已经进入幻境了吗..是因为早上的雾吗"}
{"time": 1757102210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285002069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但是能进去的人看不见”"}
{"time": 1757102256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966409669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当时出去的时候，不是说无罪者方可通过”"}
{"time": 1757102280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504036737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“让西莉丝姐姐来应该就能打开了...”"}
{"time": 1757102287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251722552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以我把那行字凿掉了”"}
{"time": 1757102310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126155638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但下半句是什么意思...”"}
{"time": 1757102363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308048957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你能参加密会不是应该脑子很好使么..怎么感觉比我还....”算了，还是不说了，说出来好像练自己也骂了"}
{"time": 1757102371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609877194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实是但丁的神曲（）"}
{"time": 1757102400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111855742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2126155638]“意思是进来了就别想活着出去”"}
{"time": 1757102459, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203978338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那你还要进去看吗”"}
{"time": 1757102462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388481718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(入此门者)"}
{"time": 1757102476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1813281556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(地狱门边的句子)"}
{"time": 1757102482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710049327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（摒弃一切希望么（）"}
{"time": 1757102492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1307268379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我又不信这个，但是进不去”"}
{"time": 1757102518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104739071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐，可以帮忙推个门吗”"}
{"time": 1757102553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244337113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以参谋小姐不来试试看吗？说起来，看着倒是恢复得不错”"}
{"time": 1757102837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282643578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当时真的是因为我打开的么?\"她扶了扶额，\"我自认不是什么全然高风亮节的完人。\"听到伊芙的话，她停了一下开口，\"当时麻烦艾络温小姐了，有幸伤得不算特别重。\""}
{"time": 1757102897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628027441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当时就三个人，不是我，不是这家伙，肯定就是西莉丝姐姐了”"}
{"time": 1757102991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135349730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不用谢我，你自己挣得的”*看着她说完，又转回去看屋子“泰坦之后有提到过关于这屋子的事么？”"}
{"time": 1757103144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1886280279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有。\"她一边说一边无奈地把手搭在门上，门纹丝不动，\"看吧，我就说和我没什么关系。\""}
{"time": 1757103197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571787551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，所以当时我们出来是有高人相助吗...”"}
{"time": 1757103201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586483967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*轻咳一声，在心里呼唤一声“妃花小姐……？”"}
{"time": 1757103210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "908948588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐，你来试试？”"}
{"time": 1757103291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409340222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=908948588]\"诶...我吗？真的假的?\"她指着自己"}
{"time": 1757103302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821262420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(诶 wusuo 哇达西天才?)"}
{"time": 1757103393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530415811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是艾璃西雅要是打不开她不就自责死了（）"}
{"time": 1757103421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236094867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个门说是只有无罪之人才能打开，艾璃西雅姐姐试试？”"}
{"time": 1757103432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1914784555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（她一开始就没有想过自己能打开对不对）"}
{"time": 1757103435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148712847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不行的啦...\"她连连摆手，不肯尝试。"}
{"time": 1757103437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551115684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哪来的负担）"}
{"time": 1757103486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848558019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "每个人都有自己的秘密，艾璃西雅姐姐不想尝试也正常"}
{"time": 1757103557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2008809432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系...反正里面也不一定有什么东西”"}
{"time": 1757103588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618971987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1586483967]\"...\"过了好几个呼吸，随着小腿上的纹身绽放了些许光芒，\"嗯...?\"似乎有些困困的样子，而你再度感受到了熟悉的身体分享的感觉，对方显然有些不太熟悉身体的运作，以至于‘你’整个人有些摇摇晃晃的，而与此同时...一股花香传遍四周。"}
{"time": 1757103592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804418661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 过意志"}
