{"time": 1757103787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586288374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你用粉末想把我弄睡着，被艾莲娜拦住了）"}
{"time": 1757103793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956174047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶嘿嘿...好香诶...\"爱璃西雅不自觉朝着伊芙的方向走着，眉眼间有些潮红，\"想亲亲抱抱举高高...诶嘿...\""}
{"time": 1757103838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554256401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1586288374]（哦还真是）"}
{"time": 1757103844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2089949985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我以为是落地爆开那种）"}
{"time": 1757103861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503021530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐..冷静一点”拽住她胳膊“...你干嘛啊,怎么一言不合就下毒”"}
{"time": 1757103884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028007799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1273455375]“你见过这个建筑吗？还有这扇门”"}
{"time": 1757103947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870678177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1503021530]\"诶...诺诺没闻到吗？好香...\""}
{"time": 1757104024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1427046770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“闻到了...但是你都不认识她，忽然想和她亲亲抱抱举高高也太奇怪了吧”"}
{"time": 1757104026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "254296562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西里斯倒是没受大的影响，鼻尖耸动的同时定睛打量了一些你小腿上的花纹，\"艾络温小姐倒是...深藏不露。\""}
{"time": 1757104102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992597255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*暂时没有回应的心思，专注在和妃花的交流上"}
{"time": 1757104156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494607131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1028007799]\"...\"‘你’看了看门，稍微歪着脑袋，身体也不再摇摇晃晃，旁边的诺维拉注意到伊芙剩下的瞳孔逐渐由紫色变成了绿色，瞳仁却是完全的白，\"没...但是妃花觉得，打得开...?\""}
{"time": 1757104199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "387545282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1427046770]\"诶...可是我不能拒绝共舞一曲的邀请啦...都这么香了...\""}
{"time": 1757104261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629086815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1494607131]“嗯，我猜也是……可以拜托你吗？”*现在轮到自己去习惯和新的意识共处一室了"}
{"time": 1757104322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103390120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃....她可是坏人，你小心一点”小声在她耳边说道"}
{"time": 1757104484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834810379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"为什么啦，感觉是很温柔的香气...\"爱璃西雅一脸不解地看向你，眨眨自己大大的装满疑惑的蓝瞳"}
{"time": 1757104544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "706881053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=629086815]\"嗯...\"‘你’走上前，伸出右手抚在黑门上，伴随着咔哒一声，黑色的门被‘你’推开。"}
{"time": 1757104573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763261183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉我应该要像个短剧的路边反派嘲讽）"}
{"time": 1757104588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688629206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（就凭你，怎么可能开门，然后哐哐打脸）"}
{"time": 1757104617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1296220814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她怎么敢去尝试的...艾璃西雅姐姐，门现在什么情况？”"}
{"time": 1757104673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394494159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=706881053]“嗯……看来妃花的确是无罪之人……不过里面可能有危险。你要接着自己来吗？”"}
{"time": 1757104807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431042896", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1296220814]\"诶...打开了，比起这个...更想...\"她盯着伊芙，有些呆呆傻傻的。西里斯从背后敲了敲她的脑袋，\"完了，这里有个本来就傻现在傻了的。\""}
{"time": 1757104838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737879056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1296220814]\"诶...打开了，比起这个...更想...\"她盯着伊芙，有些呆呆傻傻的。西里斯从背后敲了敲她的脑袋，\"完了，这里有个本来就傻现在更傻了的。\""}
{"time": 1757104858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112911608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么会....艾洛温怎么会是无罪之人...她的罪孽明明早都数不清了”"}
{"time": 1757104879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464747369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(撒，来细数你的罪孽吧)"}
{"time": 1757104886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12891934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(事到如今数的清吗)"}
{"time": 1757104888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646656002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "是花香的缘故吗.."}
{"time": 1757104923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876554575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（刻在门上你就信啊.jpg）"}
{"time": 1757105038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534123541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1394494159]\"诶...\"伊芙的声音传到你们旁人的耳边，但却是很轻柔的话音，带着些暖风拂面的感觉，\"嗯...虽然有点困...虽然...算了...\"她看向爱璃西雅，微微摇摇脑袋，\"我走啦...\"顷刻间花香散去，只留余味，伊芙的瞳孔也重新变回原先的紫色。"}
{"time": 1757105163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125308742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这....”附身还是凭依，不太懂，算了不想了，至少艾洛温本人肯定不是无罪之人"}
{"time": 1757105239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "788307492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……谢啦”*轻声道别“……总之门开了，但是我猜你们有问题”"}
