{"time": 1757264979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797536406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那很失败了）"}
{"time": 1757264980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787003430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那不记得)"}
{"time": 1757265032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1399220068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=126844506]\"呃...\"她仔细想了想，摇摇头，\"我没见过她们，有更具体的特征吗？\""}
{"time": 1757265071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570578189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“老的那个喜欢装嫩，嫩的那个喜欢装老成”"}
{"time": 1757265095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933952258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像说了吉尔内里莎和另一个人会来马纳利亚”想要回忆起那个名字，但死活想不起来，算了，摇摇头，继续说道“她们说有伊瑟尔在，那两个人掀不起什么风浪...但她们又提到了一个叫缇欧的人，说如果缇欧来的话会很麻烦...”"}
{"time": 1757265372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "936215894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"缇欧...\"停顿了片刻，\"实际上只是传说中的人物啦...比起她，似乎她们早就知道马纳利亚要发生的事情了？而且..这个意思是...学院长也知道?\""}
{"time": 1757265398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "176729685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1570578189](你说这个谁懂啊)"}
