{"time": 1757339305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311005394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1484405392]\"好啦，诺诺也不要动。\"她叫停了你，\"唉，真是，一会没看着就闹成这样。\""}
{"time": 1757339397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77742804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"都退开吧。\"她扭头看了看旁边的围观群众，又重新把目光收回来"}
{"time": 1757339421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736256975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起...西莉斯姐姐”重新松开手"}
{"time": 1757339769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688599467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我可是差点就得手了”*眼看终究是再难寸进，只能松手，把匕首捡起来收好，随后掐着自己的手腕退开两步“非得在这个节骨眼上来吗？”"}
{"time": 1757339918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985977965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“和你同归于尽对我来说还是太亏了”"}
{"time": 1757339943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959300478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"抱歉，这是大人要做的事情。\"她把你拉起来"}
{"time": 1757339959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2752943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你来找的我，又能杀不杀）"}
{"time": 1757339967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806440070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这不是犯贱吗）"}
{"time": 1757340054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676652074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我应该没什么事...”起身拍拍身上的灰"}
{"time": 1757340211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "57874263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，可以说说到底发生了什么吗？\""}
{"time": 1757340414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909517183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“就当我是我的错吧...我不应该去叫她吃饭的”"}
{"time": 1757340448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909094888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"艾络温小姐?\""}
{"time": 1757340555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "419757072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我说过很多次了，别来问我。有人非要拽着我不放，还抢走我的匕首，我又没惹她”"}
{"time": 1757340924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646923529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "稍微冷静了一下“对不起，我错了，我不该强迫你”"}
{"time": 1757341027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1052694234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧，看来艾络温小姐确实...\"她接着摸了摸诺维拉脸上的血"}
{"time": 1757341119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "620762766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*没什么表情，更没什么活力，一言不发转身就走，不过总感觉走的有些东倒西歪，地上一路滴下的血印子也弯弯曲曲"}
{"time": 1757341206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418958595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样不行。\"她递给你一袋胶带，\"我帮你先止血吧\""}
{"time": 1757341221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283071054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（胶带是？）"}
{"time": 1757341386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1286949853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(呃，绷带)"}
{"time": 1757341486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1643770407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*找一堵墙，侧着靠上去，有气无力地抬抬手“……到底是在帮谁擦屁股？”"}
{"time": 1757341759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339827036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会对你负责的....”"}
{"time": 1757341867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119665353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1757341901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980947953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是遇见的话，不能置之不理。\"她拆开绷带帮你包扎，\"仅此而已，而且，你不是要说要跟着我们一起?\""}
{"time": 1757341989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091215895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在不想了。你能忍她，我忍不了”*闭上眼睛，有点疲惫"}
{"time": 1757342069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453982418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诺诺这一次是为了你好，不肯接受别人的好意，是因为有人害过你吗？\"爱璃西雅此时也走了出来，不过站在一旁没说话"}
{"time": 1757342306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53212314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……哪有什么‘为了你好’，我做好了我的准备，但她没有做好我拒绝的准备。只是想让我听她的而已”*依旧闭着眼睛“我也没有装可怜的习惯”"}
{"time": 1757342393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143090981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...在一厢情愿这一点上，你们倒是都差不多。\"她转过头拿出纸巾帮着诺诺擦脸"}
{"time": 1757342426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005704591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……有毒的”"}
{"time": 1757342450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374124730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是...是吗，我没什么感觉啊”"}
{"time": 1757342506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689261689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还是自己来吧，西莉丝姐姐”接过纸巾擦擦脸"}
{"time": 1757342689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633121412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"她不在意地看着手上沾染的血，\"要是会中毒，我早就晕过去了才是。\""}
{"time": 1757342734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393145392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怪不得你疯了一样，要把血往我眼睛上抹”"}
{"time": 1757342859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282705131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "很快便把脸上的血擦了七七八八，刚刚脖子没有很痛，她应该没碰到脖子.."}
{"time": 1757343167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48351561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总之，既然是这个性子...\"她站起身擦起手上的血，\"之后艾络温打算如何"}
{"time": 1757343436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351526026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我有自己的事要做”"}
{"time": 1757343561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494794824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也许不是我自己的”"}
{"time": 1757343565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535795281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也就是说，不打算和我们一起?\""}
{"time": 1757343838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1717378248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“事到如今，还有什么好一起的呢？”"}
{"time": 1757343865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874415362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你看起来状态也不是很好的样子...”"}
{"time": 1757344045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1847028311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好想攻击你）"}
{"time": 1757344052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944567499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诺诺的薇拉）"}
{"time": 1757344111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568996382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我全程没有攻击你（bushi）"}
{"time": 1757344173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896365432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在这里到处都不正常，你拖着虚弱的身体能做什么..”我可不想自己的仇人死于意外情况"}
{"time": 1757344263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948727517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我说参谋，既然我和她注定没法共事，那我觉得你带着她不如带着我”"}
{"time": 1757344514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664326819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?这是什么意思?\""}
{"time": 1757344627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1885978966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“至少我带起来没那么惹人费心，而且……我这边有你要盯着的人吧”"}
{"time": 1757344779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177970637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”对她说出来的话有些震惊"}
{"time": 1757344850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413940409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（早知如此，应该一开始友善对你，刷你的好感度，然后在你最虚弱的时候背刺你，可惜那时的城府不够深）"}
{"time": 1757344919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79679048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要说这种话，我会乖乖听话的，伊芙的话也会暂时听的，除了一些坏事...”"}
{"time": 1757345144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179780516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你刚才又不是捅不死我）"}
{"time": 1757345203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208753630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...或许你说的也有道理?\"她似乎有些斟酌"}
{"time": 1757345362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163490478", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样吗...”现在是西莉丝姐姐收留了自己，自己之前还那样对西里斯姐姐，她有所考虑也合情合理“西莉丝姐姐的任何决定我都会接受的，就算西莉丝姐姐选择了她..西莉丝姐姐也是我永远的恩人”很勉强的挤出笑容"}
{"time": 1757345388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943537803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是希望西莉丝姐姐能多收留几天艾璃西雅姐姐”"}
{"time": 1757345694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482053072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1757345951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396999717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1757345954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812828837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（什么情况）"}
{"time": 1757345990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1210049442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，不管怎么说，诺维拉也算是雷维翁的一员?\"她看向你，目光有些打量的意味，\"至少在你放弃这个身份之前，我不会就这么抛下你。\"西里斯摇摇头，\"恐怕这一点上只能让艾络温小姐失望了。\""}
{"time": 1757346029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258838518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢西莉丝姐姐”开心的上去抱抱她"}
{"time": 1757346123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738390903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那算了”*无谓地耸耸肩“就此别过比较好”"}
{"time": 1757346145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045074552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要...你别走”"}
{"time": 1757346175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865602538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你到底要干嘛（））"}
{"time": 1757346184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902991961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（光说别走是？）"}
{"time": 1757346198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138654400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（让我想想怎么劝你）"}
{"time": 1757346206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545112853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是）"}
{"time": 1757346212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647445735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么要劝我，何意）"}
{"time": 1757346224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55492483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（其实我有点想监视你）"}
{"time": 1757346236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "830784806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（其次我觉得人多力量大）"}
{"time": 1757346308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695356695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"以我的观点来看，还是觉得我们既然走到了一起，不妨现在坐下来冷静谈一谈吧。\"西里斯叹口气，顺着话说"}
{"time": 1757346330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299846115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我没意见..”"}
{"time": 1757346523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865075833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……行”*终究还是看在西里斯的份上点了点头"}
{"time": 1757346778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128233735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那翔哥谈啊)"}
{"time": 1757346793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755087724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是先坐吗（）"}
{"time": 1757346913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068396222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你进店吗)"}
{"time": 1757346917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856478415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们先回餐馆坐着吧..站着谈也挺累的”"}
{"time": 1757347046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1777199783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……行”*说完直接往店里走，省去繁文缛节"}
{"time": 1757347296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1036254289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "餐桌上还遗留着没吃完的餐点，基本上可以说还剩下一半左右。尤其是熔岩蛋糕，几乎没吃几口。"}
{"time": 1757347429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517901054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也许多少有些勾馋虫，但是现在既没食欲，肚子里也没多少空间，只是单纯坐在角落"}
{"time": 1757347510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366503419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不吃两口？只是两片荞麦面包...真是的，你不吃我动手了。\"碎碎念的抱怨在你耳边响起，而西里斯有意坐到了对面，和爱璃西雅一起，把一排的空间留给了你们"}
{"time": 1757347725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954356813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "坐到伊芙身边"}
{"time": 1757347946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390984132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢你还算了我一份，但我落座的时候就已经说过不用管我了”*有些无奈，同时刻意与诺薇菈保持距离"}
{"time": 1757348023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831348487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且不止说过一次吧”"}
{"time": 1757348054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645860677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（别的不好说）"}
{"time": 1757348061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909590016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是现在，理论上，应该）"}
{"time": 1757348070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1956046994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（会低血压（））"}
{"time": 1757348078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640525048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（血量和盐分都很不妙）"}
{"time": 1757348103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859518933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你现在怎么虚弱，还是多吃点吧...”"}
{"time": 1757348116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614775566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "‘你’的手突然自己动了起来，拿起面前的勺子挖了一口蛋糕，自顾自放进嘴里，\"哦...还有微量的玛纳，倒是很有巧思。\""}
{"time": 1757348178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814253389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“早这样不就好了..”叹口气"}
{"time": 1757348296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559494013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*看看店里人多不多。不多的话，倒是有点想让妃花出来尝尝"}
{"time": 1757348488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118694930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我付不起钱，这是你想要的解释吗？”*认命般叹了口气，索性把身体的操控权全让出来"}
{"time": 1757348589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530665688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也付不起钱....但我以后会还给西莉丝姐姐的，现在不好好吃饭，就没有以后了...”"}
{"time": 1757348767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "236328836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦。\"‘伊芙’一口一口吃着蛋糕，有些旁若无人，\"我只负责吃，具体的你们慢慢谈。\"蛋糕入口是松软中带着独属于热巧的馥郁香气和冷牛奶的微甜，极大地满足了味蕾，唾液忍不住分泌，与刚刚干涩的面包形成强烈的对比，一时甚至有些...目眩?"}
{"time": 1757348851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "718533624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不在这吃我也不会饿死，大不了回去吃牢饭。”"}
{"time": 1757348924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012828675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你是准备犯罪吗...”"}
{"time": 1757348928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508247278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“而且我以为我们已经两清了”"}
{"time": 1757348965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959746268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“两清是指？”"}
{"time": 1757348968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862737188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1012828675]“怎么，你觉得买命很合理吗？”"}
{"time": 1757349092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319201434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“肯定不合理啊...人的生命怎么能用金钱衡量，所以你想凭借这个进监狱吗”"}
{"time": 1757349120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208903481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“足够了”"}
{"time": 1757349143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201631781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果你被判定了杀人，好像不是蹲几天牢就能解决的，有可能要待一辈子”"}
{"time": 1757349214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440458680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“无所谓，关不住我”"}
{"time": 1757349309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968290024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不管你嘴上怎么说，身体的动作始终没停下，甚至已经开始夹菜吃饭，显得有些...身体诚实地忠诚于本能的意思，话语就变得单薄无比..."}
{"time": 1757349579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430605408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "嘴上说着无所谓，心底倒是挺诚实，心里吐槽道，但还是不要说出来招惹她了"}
{"time": 1757349600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211835943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只要你之后和我们一起行动，我可以暂时听你的话”"}
{"time": 1757349617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297247904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*但是现在倒是能心安理得地吃了，毕竟某人刚刚又拉了一次偏架，自己应得的"}
{"time": 1757350062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988980940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好啦，我吃饱了。”卡珊德拉似乎是满意了，停下了手，至于你要不要继续，那就看你的意思了"}
{"time": 1757350121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794622901", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=211835943][CQ:at,qq=1040972910]"}
{"time": 1757350268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952890839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=211835943]“……那不重要。你没什么值得命令的。少些自我中心就谢天谢地了”"}
{"time": 1757350300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882638386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这就已经算是命令了...但我会听的”"}
{"time": 1757350529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016947020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以你是答应了吗，之后一起行动”"}
{"time": 1757350711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759122377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道你们为什么执着于这个”*或许是刚吃完甜食，此时没那么苦大仇深“但是随便吧”"}
{"time": 1757350857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019315638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你同意就好..”早这样不就什么事都没有了，心里暗暗吐槽"}
{"time": 1757351013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461897186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那么，之后，有什么打算？我早就问过了”"}
{"time": 1757351187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017965295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我也没什么头绪”"}
{"time": 1757351383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495317523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“这件事还需要慢慢定夺呢。”西里斯开口，爱璃西雅则是趴在桌子上，显然不能指望她"}
{"time": 1757351537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094832576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前不是说要去买情报么”"}
{"time": 1757351643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411666247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你知道的，我也没钱”"}
{"time": 1757351891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537683737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm”看向西莉丝姐姐"}
{"time": 1757351997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987767345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“钱的问题吗？”她的手撑着脑袋，“这种事不用担心。”"}
{"time": 1757352105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1813988648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……真是慷慨，那就找个地方碰碰运气吧”"}
{"time": 1757352206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164376484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不过，也不能说完全管用就是了。”她淡淡吐出口气，“吃好了吗？”"}
{"time": 1757352483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449425715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“多谢招待”*有些艰难地站起来，今晚吃的的确有些多了"}
{"time": 1757352805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819856281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（翔哥主导一下）"}
{"time": 1757352853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611291671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1757352871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043718590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，听说一般酒馆情报比较多？”"}
{"time": 1757353069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924525553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要我说，还是去找泰坦比较……直观”"}
{"time": 1757353119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "667253920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是泰坦的价格会不会很高....一般像这种迷信金钱的人，收费都出奇的高，而且也许他的身份说不定会有很多溢价”"}
{"time": 1757353712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84463629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说不定根本不是钱。但是去这片地方最标志的建筑物肯定没错”"}
{"time": 1757353730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394475381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你说的也有道理...那就按你说的吧”"}
