{"time": 1757500089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984799868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“放心吧。”她稍微点了点脑袋，整理了一下着装，“我相信诺诺应该不会再做出过激的事吧？当然...艾络温小姐也不要有意做这种事。”"}
{"time": 1757500089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563885081", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也没说我想去，但是急着离开的只要你吧”"}
{"time": 1757500132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188435169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（什么东西？）"}
