{"time": 1757500281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "928867772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在着急也没什么用...西莉丝姐姐不在的时候，我会努力和伊芙和平相处的”"}
{"time": 1757500434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208877414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在我倒是有地方落脚了。她不来我脸上晃，我本来是懒得管她的”"}
