{"time": 1757501144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720561388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不理睬她的挑衅，已经答应了西莉丝姐姐不能惹事.."}
{"time": 1757501162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765510497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“全靠我的良知是不是太冒险了，西丽丝小姐”*左手玩玩自己的头发"}
{"time": 1757501219, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198083819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也不能全怪我吧，这家伙惹人生气的本领你也见识过了”"}
{"time": 1757501253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329141191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那确实是见识过了)"}
{"time": 1757501327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480367770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯....\"她见状犹豫了一下，\"看起来你反而不希望我去，那艾络温小姐有没有什么好的办法呢?\""}
{"time": 1757501520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771815776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呃）"}
{"time": 1757501541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734652484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的本意其实是一起去，但是我不太好提出来）"}
{"time": 1757501630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205456975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也许我们可以叫上宾森特一起去。暴力作为三泰坦中唯一是手段而不是目的的一方，作为驱虎吞狼的虎再合适不过”"}
{"time": 1757501633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071074927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你的话都说到这份上了)"}
{"time": 1757501732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338882587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在某种程度上，它们其中任何一方都可以是手段，对不对?\""}
{"time": 1757501776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1475275776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果不是以政体为单位的话，或许”"}
{"time": 1757501842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639024767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"驱虎吞狼...如果自身实力不够，我认为是不足以登上那张谈判桌的\""}
{"time": 1757501925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962455501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也许煽风点火也够了。毕竟那位看起来也不是很想讲道理，说不定只需要一个借口”"}
{"time": 1757501980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943020936", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我们走丢了一个士兵.jpg）"}
{"time": 1757502058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64517016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...你有把握说服宾森特?\""}
{"time": 1757502071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719168669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“宾森特也不一定愿意见我们吧...”"}
{"time": 1757502175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373539634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是这样的，我本以为至少宾森特先生能上的了谈判桌，但是看来也不保险”"}
{"time": 1757502191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582208340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但我想煽风点火应该不需要上桌”"}
{"time": 1757502338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164740282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那也许如果能煽风点火让财富和暴力打起来的话..对宾森特先生好像会更有利，宾森特先生是个好人，情况对我们来说应该也会好起来吧”"}
{"time": 1757502343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "758635366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是这么说，太乏善可陈，煽风点火...你想挑起战争?\""}
{"time": 1757502445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333146878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“宜早不宜迟”*耸肩“黄金和暴力会自动从低浓度流向高浓度。法律嘛……难说”"}
{"time": 1757502470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800769465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“何况不挑起战争就会少死人么？”"}
{"time": 1757502531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637740090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"破坏力你也见到了...\"她皱着眉，\"如果是以中环覆灭为经过，就算能达成目的，也是下策。\""}
{"time": 1757502555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060569182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(诶，我要提一个游戏人生0的盟约的事了)"}
{"time": 1757502569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212582965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你是幽灵吗)"}
{"time": 1757502574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1531026000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1757502581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832646470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我已经忘得差不多了）"}
{"time": 1757502634, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780735612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“介入时机恰当的话，至少宾森特治下的区域不会那么糟”"}
{"time": 1757502643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "943920239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...还是从长计议吧,就算伊芙不考虑其他人，按照暴力的那个实力，我们也很难幸免吧...”"}
{"time": 1757503215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2141426743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，长到什么时候？法师塔再倒一批？”"}
{"time": 1757503288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1019809437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我怎么感觉我的立场这么……正）"}
{"time": 1757503313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410862216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，提醒我了”"}
{"time": 1757503332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559653096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“该去法师塔附近捡捡垃圾了”"}
{"time": 1757503585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867140868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也是，不能拖了，可恶....到底该怎么办”"}
{"time": 1757503759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "663298590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还有一个办法...找到纳克雅...\"西里斯喃喃自语"}
{"time": 1757503792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946940291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“纳克雅？谁？”"}
{"time": 1757503839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "861530434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“莎木纳克雅？”"}
{"time": 1757503855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340556305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个打伤西莉丝姐姐的人...”"}
{"time": 1757504080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245083524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不认识，找她干嘛？”"}
{"time": 1757504477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1238919302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有依据认为...目前的情况是由她导致。\""}
{"time": 1757505144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013384416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她是谁？灾杰？”"}
{"time": 1757505617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255486910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“光知道名字和始作俑者也很难有什么认知啊”"}
{"time": 1757505631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150776007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(休息一下)"}
{"time": 1757505639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095861633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我看翔哥挺忙的)"}
{"time": 1757505649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160348915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（一般）"}
{"time": 1757505652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320656348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(忙去吧)"}
{"time": 1757516183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382689923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有吗）"}
{"time": 1757516246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662701702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有吗）"}
{"time": 1757517157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177226510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(待会吧)"}
{"time": 1757517532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961820059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1757520360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067566270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1757520505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047274296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的"}
{"time": 1757520583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164802537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1757520703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990551207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1238919302]“依据是？”有些好奇"}
{"time": 1757520801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244842018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不是跟你说过吗？诺诺。\""}
{"time": 1757520856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376763746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1149143167]（这个？）"}
{"time": 1757520967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "738339813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1934470728]()"}
{"time": 1757520969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400383688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉西莉丝姐姐..这几天发生太多事了，我脑子有点乱...”仔细回想一下“桥梁？”"}
{"time": 1757521074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565397125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...就像是覆盖了这处地方的规则，从什么方面看..都像是罪魁祸首。而且...我的伤也是\""}
{"time": 1757521120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "613236206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以三位泰坦也是她选的？”"}
{"time": 1757521194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766325970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不...感觉，那种家伙做不出这种事\""}
{"time": 1757521276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "89830047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，也许是她的妥协？有人与她的能力进行了对抗，泰坦是对抗的产物？”大胆提出猜想"}
{"time": 1757521318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733134831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”"}
{"time": 1757521346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1676398527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你不会真打算指望16岁的没点政治的人告诉你这是社会学实验吧）"}
{"time": 1757521480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970884530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那家伙还干过哪些事？”"}
{"time": 1757521713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534185828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=89830047]“嗯...也许，是有人和她之间蓄意配合出的结果...”她沉思了一会，“倒不是说纳克雅干过什么事...她的权柄是混融，这么说就很清楚了吧？”"}
{"time": 1757521810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931340183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……将这里的出入也揉在一起了吗”*思考一番“那这些人……应该也有两副原料？”"}
{"time": 1757521937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194970626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"两副原料?\"有些惊讶于你提出的话，她开口"}
{"time": 1757522035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50598684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“混融，总不能只有一项原料……而对三泰坦出现抱有怀疑和疑惑的人也太少了，存在感太过……自然。”"}
{"time": 1757522084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933390752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我觉得两份原料其中之一，应该是这中环原本有的人。其余部分……我当然也不会知道来自哪儿。但是伊瑟尔显然算漏了”"}
{"time": 1757522167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648802811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我想融合的也许不止有人也说不定。\"她看向窗外，\"人...规则...乃至权能。\""}
{"time": 1757522320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518727460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那为什么我们没有被融合...大概吧”"}
{"time": 1757522413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090016613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也搞不清楚”*摇头“太自然了。”"}
{"time": 1757522433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505611925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就没有权能是分割的人吗？”"}
{"time": 1757522439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565577704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（水鬼（）"}
{"time": 1757522461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584269558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯....我们其实接受了这个世界，对不对?\"她突然这么开口，\"哪怕存在种种异常...我们仍然自然地接受了现在这个异常的规则...\""}
{"time": 1757522619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704414820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……我还有事要做。停一天两天还则罢了”*走到她面前“我不讨论世界对和不对的问题。我只知道外面还有人等我”"}
{"time": 1757522757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78180774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是就算知道是莎木那刻雅干的...我们也找不到她啊，关于她，我们一点头绪都没..”叹口气“要是能轻易遇到她或者和她相关的人就好了”"}
{"time": 1757522785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123204442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1757522868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839064074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1757522871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800789892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“你们难道没有遇见吗？”她指了指诺维拉，“吉尔内莉莎，里榭娜。”指了指伊芙，“加缪尔...嗯...”"}
{"time": 1757522961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1150869750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“里榭娜姐姐...”听到她名字莫名感觉有点开心"}
{"time": 1757523024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668345520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……现在也没处找去……非要说有没有相似，就我的体验而言，又有点牵强”"}
{"time": 1757523064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611670713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是我也不知道她姐姐在哪...如果知道的话，我应该已经去找她了”"}
{"time": 1757523263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325703774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“相似？”她的目光落在伊芙身上，“如果寻求他们之间的相似点，大概是找不出来。”耸耸肩，“本身...她们原本也不应该在一起行动。”"}
{"time": 1757523338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146268538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的意思是……三个对三个。但是据我所知加缪尔没有那种……把建筑捏成方块的办法”"}
{"time": 1757523432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576197810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"绝杰提供能力给泰坦的...意思?\"轻轻摇头，\"据我所知，对不上。\""}
{"time": 1757523485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280073375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也就打过一个照面……之后就没见过了。见了也没用”"}
{"time": 1757523523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717962427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1576197810]（不是灾杰？）"}
{"time": 1757523529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1512974396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(差不多啦)"}
{"time": 1757523578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671706310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"应该还存在其他的协作者...由纳克雅提供场地，另一批人...提供了泰坦的能力。\""}
{"time": 1757523721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719456239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后呢.jpg）"}
{"time": 1757523764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285755629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以，就像龙芙小姐说的一样。我们有两条路。\""}
{"time": 1757523767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203246248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "停了"}
{"time": 1757523788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459551753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就，告诉我们还有高手）"}
{"time": 1757523797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "262616005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有什么用.jpg）"}
{"time": 1757523815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712294554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的交互按键呢.jpg）"}
{"time": 1757523867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537289703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这里还有好多无辜的被卷进来的平民.....”"}
{"time": 1757524037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442465519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有这些平民...就没有必要做出这样的场地，对不对?\"她叹口气，\"我也不清楚到底是谁，提供了这样的权能...不过怎么看，都觉得应该与国王或是...皇帝有关...嗯...最起码，应该是某个国家的政要?\""}
{"time": 1757524058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820107465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎）"}
{"time": 1757524062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290598974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你的意思是）"}
{"time": 1757524227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435469010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……刚刚不就有一个？”"}
{"time": 1757524340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171887577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“她的话确实...耐人寻味...”西里斯看了看身后的人偶，“但是考虑到马纳利亚的归属权...臣与属.的关系上看..我倾向于..不是。”她摇头"}
{"time": 1757524399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49989220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这不还有个king？”"}
{"time": 1757524427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021260154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“艾希连得凛克确有其人吗？”"}
{"time": 1757524455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778544051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“或者说..神様？”"}
{"time": 1757524506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590556286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“马纳利亚的掌权者？伊瑟尔？”"}
{"time": 1757524795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248639114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"学院长?\""}
{"time": 1757524863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "915399184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起，我只是瞎说的...”"}
{"time": 1757524904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892566133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这种时刻...还是不要轻易怀疑那位了。\"她伸出手敲了敲诺维拉的脑袋"}
{"time": 1757525053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572011149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就算是，也还是先关注能摸得到的部分吧”*有些头疼，左手卷头发一路卷到发根“要在偌大一个中环找本就是物主的灾杰……”"}
{"time": 1757525064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125718867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2021260154]\"哦～至少我们现在没有见过呢。\"她开口，\"可以帮我们带几杯牛奶吗？\"身后的人偶应声走了出去。"}
{"time": 1757525199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573505464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "·\"当然，我们现在能直接接触的...还是那三位泰坦吧？”她看到人偶走出门，换了个语气，“刚刚的话，你们信了几分。”"}
{"time": 1757525241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549552312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……咳”*别过脸去"}
{"time": 1757525263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412557717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”"}
{"time": 1757525270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105246560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刚刚的话是假的吗”"}
{"time": 1757525317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035632070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“说的是人偶的主人的话。”她翻了个白眼，“我说的，大部分也是说给她听。”"}
{"time": 1757525408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547867721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哦哦，她也没和我说几句话...”"}
{"time": 1757525619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "591364054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“至于跟伊芙小姐说的...”"}
{"time": 1757525674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795439689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那诺诺应该也听得很清楚吧？”西里斯看了看房门，皱着眉想着什么，“龙芙...她在想什么？说的这些话又能信多少...”"}
{"time": 1757525804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256464172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“龙芙小姐是想让三位泰坦三和一吗？”"}
{"time": 1757526037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1741653234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也可能是作为统治者，探寻三者哪个会胜出，以此探究繁荣的道路……但是也完全没必要来找一趟我们，我们能有什么价值？”"}
{"time": 1757526040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706538695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“她本人真的有这个意思吗？”"}
{"time": 1757526090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1957694510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1741653234]“能意识到现在的情况不对劲 也许就是我们潜在的价值...”"}
{"time": 1757526140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743232469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“全盘否定的话，我们只能当没见过这个人了”*摇摇头“……说不定泰坦本人也不熟识她”"}
{"time": 1757526265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726795817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不，她说的肯定也不全是错误的...只是”"}
{"time": 1757526302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1130515698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“得找佐证吧。但是完全无从验证喔”"}
{"time": 1757526396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699912748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...就是这样。”她点点头，“我们完全是道听途说，就算...所谓的神这些话...也一样。”"}
{"time": 1757526443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287255567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“作证的话，果然还要去找找暴力那边的人吗...”"}
{"time": 1757526450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215014937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有人会读心吗？这里”*有点累了，在沙发上坐下"}
{"time": 1757526649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322502239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=9C6037A20E395F498C05130EEBEBDEB5.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQSvqpGKCXh3F5FkQFUta0snnqqaxjjlwIg_woowM7C_ODOjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQPyiGkdFein1fXqxbiqtdhXoCSlI&amp;rkey=CAMSMK_hUcBkQAcdJl3oF4xPv9tPpF_9flfClq6sG7qfeVnULgJPC_ElW4PaA-I71_vbJw,file_size=35811]"}
{"time": 1757526660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2029582086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(绷不住了，这guma长得像uzi一样)"}
{"time": 1757526667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186832555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1757526773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803146031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1215014937]“没有呢。”她摊开手，“好啦，不过现在我们也有了不少的情报，比起之前还是要好不少呢。”"}
{"time": 1757526836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131245662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“至少幕后黑手我们找到了..如果下次碰到里榭娜姐姐的话，我会尽量问问她关于莎木那刻雅的事的...”"}
{"time": 1757526871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842771103", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“很难说有假情报和没有情报哪个更糟”*扶额，可能因为失血可能因为暴食，总之有点困，克制地伸个懒腰后就有点眯起眼来"}
{"time": 1757527137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136949835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“困了吗？”西里斯转向你，“要不要去休息一会，我带着诺诺出去转转。”"}
{"time": 1757527259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982963532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“事好多……想不动了……”*蜷缩起来“就一会……”"}
{"time": 1757527286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566062048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1131245662]对你的话，她略有些无奈地扶额，但没有发表更多的意见，“我们出去转转？”眨了眨眼"}
{"time": 1757527316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229053251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啊，不过艾璃西雅姐姐呢，她也睡了吗”"}
{"time": 1757527521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869732547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1982963532]“那...艾络温小姐在这里休息一会？”西里斯吐出口气，“爱璃西雅，让她休息一会吧...昨天晚上好像没睡的样子。”"}
{"time": 1757527601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1666302805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊？”但好像也在情理之中“嗯，那我们出去逛逛吧...”"}
{"time": 1757527811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694073766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“待会人偶小姐回来...”她继续说，“请艾络温帮我们完善一下理由...”她检查了一下随身的东西，站起身。"}
{"time": 1757528242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901566122", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧，西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1757528251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265195625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "挽起她的胳膊，出门"}
{"time": 1757528559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484139009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1694073766]“哦……我就说你们去找宾森特了……”"}
{"time": 1757528560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198664609", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(龙哥真睡了？)"}
{"time": 1757528689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376448808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那么"}
{"time": 1757529161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461618040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那么？）"}
{"time": 1757529291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868489434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你和西里斯回到了大街上，伊芙稍等了一会...人偶推开了门"}
{"time": 1757529360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034130671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "夜间的街道上，行人渐少，只有零星几个人。"}
{"time": 1757529375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035150560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔……热牛奶来了。放在几子上就好了，我一会自己拿……”"}
{"time": 1757529401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025672360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐有什么话要和我说吗”"}
{"time": 1757529444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1007431291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诺维拉小姐和西里斯小姐去哪了？在房间吗？”人偶把一杯牛奶放在桌子上,\"我去送给她们。"}
{"time": 1757529559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659292747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1025672360]“去娜哈特那边看看吧。”她盯着北边一点的街道"}
{"time": 1757529636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209689436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“他们去找宾森特说事了”*眼睛睁开一条缝“埃利西亚倒是还在”"}
{"time": 1757529659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940652355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啊”事已至此，情报果然还是最重要的啊“希望能有新的收获...”"}
{"time": 1757529796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584610241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=209689436]人偶歪了歪头，水晶制的眼瞳里闪过一丝疑惑，不过很快就被收了起来，“诺亚知道了...”她又放下两杯牛奶，端起一杯敲了敲房间的门，随后推开门走了进去。"}
{"time": 1757529832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578877604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=940652355]“在这件事上，一切要听我的，知道吗？”"}
{"time": 1757529881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "155844814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...西莉丝姐姐让我往东，我就不会往西”"}
{"time": 1757529958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800412876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=155844814]“...”也不知道她信了没有，总之她带着你穿过街道，一路向倾塌的废墟那边走去。"}
{"time": 1757530282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152675856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看四周“随手就造成了这样的伤亡...明明有那么强大的力量，却用在这种地方”"}
{"time": 1757530347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751250232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一路静悄悄..直到你们穿过废墟...看见..一个崭新的发亮的满是霓虹灯装饰的建筑出现在你们面前，门口站着两个白衣的壮汉，偶尔有几个人进去，但是看了一会也没人出来。"}
{"time": 1757530485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059518385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好闪...”眼睛微微眯起来“好浮夸的审美”"}
{"time": 1757530672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335966633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好快的走）"}
{"time": 1757530680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269892844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡了，希望明天起来发烧）"}
{"time": 1757530827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693533395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这建筑一共三层，整体呈现金色和红色，看上去浮夸无比，正面似乎是仿照了天守阁的摸样，但由于过于矮所以看上去反而不伦不类，再加上挂着繁复的霓虹灯，显得更加怪模怪样"}
{"time": 1757530829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "12420912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1757530837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1188943222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你可以假装发烧，然后和我一起做）"}
{"time": 1757530839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146089047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（开题报告）"}
{"time": 1757530919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774953000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想说点什么，但毕竟在别人的地盘.....还是忍住了"}
{"time": 1757531083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635135562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西里斯明显...也有些不太舒服，皱了皱眉头，对你伸出手"}
{"time": 1757531704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840891420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1757560280, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1443763975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1757560298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314212769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=635135562][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 牵起她的手“走吧，西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1757560577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610044586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”她点了点头，带着你往建筑的方向走去，一靠近你们就闻到了一股浓浓的酒精挥发的气味，在靠近门口的时候，你们被这里站着的白衣壮汉拦下"}
{"time": 1757560639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557560663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了....”"}
{"time": 1757560658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106460631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然我看着不大，但其实我已经成年了”"}
{"time": 1757560687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308846769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得不是成年的问题（）"}
{"time": 1757560712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670937153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=584610241]过了一会她才出来， 手里端着喝了一半的杯子，她走到桌边站定，你感觉她似乎在打量着你"}
{"time": 1757560797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168195940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么了吗？……有别的床铺么？沙发还是有点不舒服……”*也抬头看着她"}
{"time": 1757561026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005084137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=308846769]（酒精挥发我先猜这里其实还是酒吧（））"}
{"time": 1757561037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544091728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2106460631]其中一个壮汉仔细打量了你一会，“力量，不符合。”他的眉头皱了皱，“你不可入内。”"}
{"time": 1757561048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033823934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得只是酒池肉林）"}
{"time": 1757561072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894007224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我力气其实蛮大的...你不能以貌取人啊”"}
{"time": 1757561079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809953485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（成不成年又不重要，都唯力量论了）"}
{"time": 1757561107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1595513698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你都没有什么测试，就说我力量小，是不是不太合适”"}
{"time": 1757561347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1586645500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1168195940]“没什么..”她摇了摇头 ，“诺亚有点好奇，为什么你，对人偶感兴趣。”"}
{"time": 1757561458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029495935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“因为好看又听话啊……又方便又不会多嘴”*眨眨眼睛“而且效率很高”"}
{"time": 1757561820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710366323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1595513698]“嚯？那你就展示一番吧。” 他看着你，不免有些讥笑"}
{"time": 1757562118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "824147261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你这家伙...”不过先看看西莉斯姐姐，已经答应了要听她话，先询问一下她的意见吧"}
{"time": 1757562245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280796533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1029495935]“...”她停了一下，“您...怎么看待龙芙小姐...” 这似乎不是一个疑问句"}
{"time": 1757562336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1115169297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……有点神秘，让人摸不清楚”*歪歪头“这才说了几句话？只有这点印象嘛”"}
{"time": 1757562350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419356539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以吗，西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1757562806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164261047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1115169297]“嗯...但是...人偶一点也不特别...只要有素材，要多少就有多少...诺亚原本就只有编号..” 她小声喃喃自语"}
{"time": 1757562960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751609600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（话题跳的好快（）"}
{"time": 1757563019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251129042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*挑了挑眉“那你的名字是？”"}
{"time": 1757563094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014038965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1419356539]“这里的规矩一向如此？”她摇摇头，“那就试试吧。”"}
{"time": 1757563127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715523041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，但是怎么试呢，打你一拳”疑惑的看向那个白衣大汉"}
