{"time": 1757586336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1786457330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=673869203]（那有吗）"}
{"time": 1757586356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863714471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1251129042]\"诺亚。\"她指着自己，\"姑且有这样的名字，嗯...\"她似乎有些话忍住了没说，\"伊芙小姐准备休息了吧？我先离开...\""}
{"time": 1757586389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50735814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我感觉龙哥的意思是谁给她起的名字（）"}
{"time": 1757586392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391492627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没，我是想问……谁帮你取的吗？”"}
{"time": 1757586463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417616932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=930304216]几桌人围在一起，似乎在进行某种纸片为主题的赌博，呼声最高。"}
{"time": 1757586817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716598451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=391492627]\"诺维拉小姐，嗯....虽然不知道为什么...\"她似乎对这个问题也有些茫然，\"...我不算特别。\""}
{"time": 1757586943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228362745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们去看看吧，西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1757586949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272334887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“只是看看...”"}
{"time": 1757587015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570779882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=716598451]“区别不大，名字终究是个没什么意义的代称……什么祝福啊、祈愿啦……都是形式”*翻了个身，没有再直视她“最终都要看做了什么……人偶都和你一样，会想这些东西吗？”"}
{"time": 1757587379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442613467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1272334887]\"小孩子不要学赌博。\"她拉着你，离人群远远的，那些人扭曲在一起，或笑或哭，完全肆意地放纵，像是人性自然的画卷。"}
{"time": 1757587517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101292082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不...对人偶而言，名字...很重要，赋予名字就意味着...共享一些...\"她慢慢开口，到这里停了下来，\"而且...世上有...很特别的人偶，出生就拥有名字。\""}
{"time": 1757587563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186045161", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我没有想要学啦...只是那边人多的话，也许更可能有些 emmm，线索？”"}
{"time": 1757587775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941692073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=186045161]\"那边不过是赌徒吧？\"西里斯无奈地摇摇头，\"酒精...赌博，滋生暴力的温床.. \"她突然想到了什么，\"我们回去。\""}
{"time": 1757587799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057916443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？我们不才刚来么..怎么又要走”"}
{"time": 1757587816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811705800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1101292082]*对这样的话题兴致不高，说到底也不是会开导人的性格，于是最后敷衍一句“……那就找个不把你当人偶的人呗”"}
{"time": 1757587970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76962270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=811705800]\"嗯...\"她不说话了，过了一会才开口，\"影响到小姐休息了。\"你看不见她，但也能察觉到她逐渐走远。"}
{"time": 1757587990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066435495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，没有缘分）"}
{"time": 1757587997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "324415922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1057916443]\"...听我的就行。\"她牵着你就要走。此时你可以过侦查"}
