{"time": 1757588253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362235073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果是个亚撒西的卡，这时候就拉着诺亚促膝长谈了）"}
{"time": 1757588270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1974745165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可惜已经放下了助人情节，那就，无缘）"}
{"time": 1757588365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216814921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2006810860]余光瞥见她进了一旁的空房间，作为家居人偶，她离开房间显然也不可能。不过此刻客厅里只剩下你躺在沙发上 ，有一层薄毯被整齐地叠好，放在一旁。显然是刻意准备的。"}
{"time": 1757588436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809547047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1985168531]你注意到...一直有些虎视眈眈的男人盯着你的铁手环。此外，这里似乎本身就没多少女性的样子，有的话也是些虎背熊腰的蛋白质女神。"}
{"time": 1757588493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790335423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抓紧西莉丝姐姐的手，感觉稍微安心了一点"}
{"time": 1757589210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257497727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1758596462]灵感"}
